WEBVTT

00:07:28.754 --> 00:07:32.776
I was always involved in teaching
in lots of different ways.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.125
AG: Conrey Callahan
started teaching high school

00:07:35.149 --> 00:07:37.186
in Philadelphia in 2008.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.786
She was fresh out of college,
excited about her career

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.906
and the opportunity
to create a better future

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.576
for the next generation.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.836
But her school district was broke

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.986
and the obstacles were big.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:51.811
About half the students Conrey taught
dropped out of high school,

00:07:51.835 --> 00:07:53.009
few made it to college,

00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:56.816
and just a small fraction
of those students would go on to graduate.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.686
CC: I remember one of my students --

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.806
he was a really, really bright kid,